# scan-to-paperless: Multi-user configuration
# -----------------------------------------------
# Format (colon-separated):
#   smb_user:smb_password:smb_share:paperless_api_key:paperless_tags
#
# smb_user        - Linux/SMB username. Unique, no spaces.
# smb_password    - Password for the SMB share.
# smb_share       - Share name visible to the scanner (e.g. alice_scans).
# paperless_api_key - API token from Paperless Settings > API Tokens.
# paperless_tags  - Optional. Comma-separated Paperless-NGX tag names (or
#                   numeric tag IDs). Names are resolved to IDs once when
#                   the watcher for that user starts -- the tag must
#                   already exist in Paperless at that point (create it in
#                   Paperless first, then start/restart this container).
#                   An unresolvable name is skipped with a [WARN] in the
#                   logs; it never blocks the upload itself.
#
#                   A tag unique to a user also doubles as the trigger
#                   condition for a Paperless Workflow (Settings ->
#                   Workflows, trigger "Document Added") that assigns
#                   owner/view/change permissions automatically -- see the
#                   README section on automating ownership via Workflows.
#
# Lines starting with # and empty lines are ignored.
#
# Usernames and share names must match ^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_-]*$ (letters,
# digits, '_'/'-', starting with a letter) -- anything else is skipped.
#
# The container ships with a fixed pool of 32 internal Samba accounts
# (SMB_POOL_SIZE build arg). Each line here is assigned to one pool slot at
# startup, in order; lines beyond the pool size are skipped with a warning.
# Rebuild the image with --build-arg SMB_POOL_SIZE=<larger> to support more
# than 32 simultaneous users.
# -----------------------------------------------

alice:secretpassword1:alice_scans:paperless-api-token-alice:scanned,alice
bob:secretpassword2:bob_docs:paperless-api-token-bob:scanned,bob
carol:secretpassword3:carol:paperless-api-token-carol:
